---
description: Optional target_model is never inferred
---

`target_model` is optional. Use it only when the caller named a snapshot.

If it is empty, render the portable base. Do not infer a model from the
session, the executor, or a default family. Do not open adapters.md. Do
not mention other model families or their knobs. Omit `target_model`,
`effort`, and `verbosity` from execution hints.

An explicit but unknown snapshot stays portable. Do not guess a family
from a name prefix.
